 October, 2011", "numcites": 32, "numcitedby": 4, "headline": "unauthorized   <b>use</b>   of   <b>electricity</b>   has   taken \n\n\n\nplace,   the   <b>assessment</b>   shall   be   made   for   the   entire   period \n\n\n\nduring   which   such   unauthorized   <b>use</b>   of   <b>electricity</b>   has   taken ... during which \n\nsuch <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> has taken place and if, \n\nhowever, the period during which such <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of \n\n<b>electricity</b> has taken place", "docsize": 132018, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Supreme Court of India", "author": "S Kumar", "authorEncoded": "swatanter-kumar"}, {"tid": 95828096, "catids": null, "doctype": 1000, "publishdate": "2019-08-21", "authorid": 385, "bench": [385, 953], "title": "West Bengal State <b>Electricity</b> ... vs M/S Orion Metal Pvt. Ltd. on 21 August, 2019", "numcites": 17, "numcitedby": 21, "headline": "assessing officer reaches to\n                              the conclusion that <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of\n                              <b>electricity</b>   has   taken   place,   the\n                              <b>assessment</b> shall be made for the entire\n                              period during ... which such unauthorized\n                              <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> has taken place and\n                              if, however, the period during which\n                              such <b>unauthorised</b> <b>use</b> of <b>electricity</b> has\n                              taken place cannot", "docsize": 64495, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Supreme Court of India", "author": "R S Reddy", "authorEncoded": "r-s-reddy", "citation": "AIRONLINE 2019 SC 982"}, {"tid": 107947830, "catids": [175], "doctype": 1000, "publishdate": "2022-10-18", "authorid": 971, "bench": [120, 971], "title": "Bses Rajdhani Power Ltd. vs Delhi <b>Electricity</b> Regulatory ... on 18 October, 2022", "numcites": 23, "numcitedby": 4, "h